        <h2>II. Frontlines of Destruction: Key Regional Case Studies</h2>

        <p>To fully grasp the magnitude of the urban wetland crisis, one must examine the specific ecological battlegrounds where urbanization has pushed ecosystems to the absolute brink of total collapse.</p>

